ource_verification","html":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A^2\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in A^A\">\\(F\\in A^A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{[n]}\">\\(F^{[n]}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bb3bb78c5caf074d\" href=\"?note=bb3bb78c5caf074d\" title=\"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy\">56-df-many-step-functional-strategy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^*\">\\(\\to^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cofinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cofinal}\\)</span> 的归约方向见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e157b5303bf9951\" href=\"?note=5e157b5303bf9951\" title=\"56-df-cofinal\">56-df-cofinal</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\bigl(a\\to^*b\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(b\\to^*F^{[n]}(a))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\bigl(a\\to^*b\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(b\\to^*F^{[n]}(a))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个起点的所有可达对象都能再归约到该策略轨道上的某点。公式直接展开归约图内的共尾条件，避免把整个A作为每个起点的可达域。正规化仅关心存在正规形的起点；共尾性也约束无正规形起点，因此严格更强。</p>\n<p>来源的OCR页块序号按本地提取文本中的分页符编号，不等同于DjVu物理页码。本轮未作机器证明；计算性未编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"bb3bb78c5caf074d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-cofinal","status":"resolved","id":"5e157b5303bf9951","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-cofinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"bb3bb78c5caf074d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}$ 与 $F^{[n]}$ 见 [[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]；$\\to^*$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}$ 与 $F^{[n]}$ 见 [[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]；$\\to^*$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-cofinal","status":"resolved","id":"5e157b5303bf9951","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cofinal}$ 的归约方向见 [[56-df-cofinal]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\to\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in A^A","display":false}